    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Raising awarenes and capacity building on circular economy benefits</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. One online workshop was organized on the topic of development of the Roadmap towards Circular Economy in Montenegro, with 60 participants</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Support advancing Energy Equity through Energy Communities 
2. Support the Process of Drafting and Formulation of the Local Energy Plan for Old Royal Capital Cetinje
3. Support the process of drafting the Circular Economy Roadmap for Montenegro
4. Support the process of drafting the Roadmap for Decarbonization of Transport Sector in MNE
5. Support the development of revised Concept Note for the Low-carbon and Climate Resilient Public Bus Transport in MNE</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. regulatory framework implemented with a goal of support advancing Energy Equity through Energy Communities 
2. expertise provided as support to Drafting and Formulation of the Local Energy Plan for Old Royal Capital Cetinje
3. Circular Economy Roadmap finalized
4. The Roadmap for Decarbonization of Transport Sector in MNE finalized
5. The Concept Note for the Low-carbon and Climate Resilient Public Bus Transport in MNE revised and a request for GCF PPF support prepared for submission to the GCF</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
